      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T17:33:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about increasing the debounce time for GPIO_AC_PRESENT?  The Icelake power sequencing takes a minimum of of 60 ms from a power signal change to updating the power state because of the requirements to pass through DSW_PWROK (10ms delay) and ALL_SYS_PWRGD (50ms delay).\n\nTry increasing CONFIG_EXTPOWER_DEBOUNCE_MS in the lindar board.h file:\n\n#undef  CONFIG_EXTPOWER_DEBOUNCE_MS\n#define CONFIG_EXTPOWER_DEBOUNCE_MS 100",
      "parentUuid": "cc73433b_b4cbbb2c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 404,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 404,
